      <groundspeak:short_description html="True">&lt;b&gt;05 October 2026, 10:00 - 10:30&lt;/b&gt;</groundspeak:short_description>
      <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h2 style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://img.geocaching.com:443/20cdeef5-f181-4020-83dc-5799d2bd1fb3.jpg" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
 &lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h2 style="text-align:center;"&gt;London Calling on Tour in Nebraska - exactly 100 degrees west of Greenwich, London&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 style="text-align:center;"&gt;Monday, October 5, 2026, 10am to 10.30am&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://img.geocaching.com:443/3ea861cc-8ded-423e-ac6d-1c3bc219a91a.jpg" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the geocaching event in the middle of Nebraska, not at any old place on the prairies but exactly 100° west of London, England.&lt;br /&gt;
Join the hosts from this English capital city to chat about all things geocaching. We are on a tour of the Midwest visiting States that we haven&amp;#39;t been to before. &lt;br /&gt;
Meet 100° on the Cowboy Trail, parking is nearby, waypoint given. The Cowboy Trail is a multi used trail along the old railroad route...there is something here! &lt;br /&gt;
 &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;London Calling 2027 Mega takes place on May 8 at Greenwich, London -  the home of the coordinates and time. &lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a rel="nofollow" href="https://coord.info/GCBJK18"&gt;London Calling Mega link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional Waypoints&lt;/p&gt;P0BVK0H - Parking&lt;br /&gt;N 42° 33.570 W 100° 00.500&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
      <groundspeak:encoded_hints>Easy, we will probably be the only people here.</groundspeak:encoded_hints>
      <groundspeak:logs>
        <groundspeak:log id="1388260230">
          <groundspeak:date>2026-10-05T19:00:00Z</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Attended</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="465298">goldpot</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="False">I had visions of this place being wind swept and wet, it was windy, but very dry and warm. 
Great to stand exactly 100° West of Greenwich, the coordinates that we live by. 
Do come and join us for the London Calling 2027 Mega on May 8th - legs astride the Meridian Line. 
Happy caching, guessed we may not have any attendees at this cache desert spot in Nebraska 

**goldpot 🇬🇧 #33911**</groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="1388172383">
          <groundspeak:date>2026-10-05T15:48:16Z</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Write note</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="465298">goldpot</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="False">On our way. </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="1376149884">
          <groundspeak:date>2026-08-03T19:00:00Z</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Will Attend</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="465298">goldpot</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="False">Will be there, 100 degrees from home! </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="1376149328">
